  "traceWhy": "A blurry photo of a poster (light blue passages with grey outlines, uneven light: the paper is bluish on the left): the blue fill alone floods the paper, so the paper is taken from the large regions outside the outlines (paperOutside, notOutside), united with the drawn walls' band (inkBand) for the narrow passages. Blank-paper boxes on the left mask photo noise. Close parallel passages sometimes merge and some short dead-end tips are lost.",
